  "notes": [
    "The rate page applies to contracts dated 2021/8/16 onward ('sokuji' = immediate payout version); an older page (index_seizon_kyufutsuki_shushin_choice, to 2021/8/15) is not collected.",
    "The history page has two tables, 【終身保障なし】 (no whole-life cover after the payout period, first table) and 【終身保障あり】 (second table), by 受取回数 (number of survival-benefit payouts): USD and AUD 5, 7, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30; JPY 5-10, 15, 20, 25, 30 (終身保障なし); 3, 5, 7, 10 (終身保障あり).",
    "The per-currency and per-cover params on the live page (..._usd_ari etc.) belong to the graph pages; the history table is served at the single param seizon_kyufutsuki_sokuji_shushin_choice_01.",
    "Editions listed share the policy form and rate page on the insurer's rate hub.",
    "Distributors: 銀行・信用金庫・信用組合・証券 section only; 乗合代理店 (independent agencies) not recorded.",
    "Mapping (changed 2026-11-17; earlier files had term_years = number of payouts and age_band mult1 / mult3): term_years is the 積立利率保証期間 (rate-guarantee period), the tenor. In the 【終身保障あり】 tables it is printed as 20年 for every column; the columns also split by 終身保障倍率 (whole-life cover multiple 1倍 or 3倍) and 受取回数, both now in the plan key (e.g. shushin_ari_x3_n7 = 3x cover, 7 payouts; plan_base shushin_ari). In the 【終身保障なし】 tables the history page prints only 受取回数; the rate page (rate_seizon_kyufutsuki_sokuji_shushin_choice_01 snapshot of 2026-11-17) prints the 積立利率保証期間 beside it and it is the number of payouts minus one year for every column (5回 4年 ... 30回 29年), so term_years = payouts - 1 and the plan stays shushin_nashi. scripts/dfl.py applies the same rule (it reads the guarantee column wherever the table prints it).",
    "The MVA (市場価格調整用利率) history page has three tables in this order: ■終身保障部分 【終身保障あり】 (whole-life cover part, table 0), ■生存給付金部分 【終身保障なし】 (table 1) and ■生存給付金部分 【終身保障あり】 (table 2); the series use table indexes 0, 1, 2 accordingly (plans shushin_ari_cover, shushin_nashi, shushin_ari_payout). The crediting-rate page has two tables, なし then あり.",
    "Launch date not established (left null). The only release naming this line is id=989 (2021-08-06): 『プレミアストーリー４』 on sale from 2021-08-16, replacing 『プレミアストーリー３』 (on sale from 2020-11, month only). No release announces 『プレミアストーリー５』; the first edition of the formal 生存給付金付終身保険（通貨指定型）is not in the release index (2008-2026). Snapshot sources/dfl/pages/release_989_2026-11-17.pdf.",
    "Launch date search 2026-11-17 (second pass): DFL release lists 2025-2026 and the bodies of saved release PDFs; two web searches for プレミアストーリー５ 取扱開始. No release or bank notice found. Still null."
  ],
  "notes_en": [
    "Rate history starts on 1 October 2025 and covers USD, AUD and JPY.",
    "The rates apply to contracts dated 16 August 2021 or later; the older rate table is not collected.",
    "Two courses exist, with and without whole-life cover. The tenor is the rate-guarantee period: 20 years with cover, and the number of payouts less one year without; the cover multiple and number of payouts are part of the plan name.",
    "Premier Story M5 and Anshin Nagatsuzuki 5 share the same rates. Launch date not established."
  ],
